 "inference": [
  "The table is the loader's slot-binding list, so the id-to-check pairing is stored: the firing gate slot 0x558 is bound to the Ability_Commando_Base id, and the LMG sprint gate slot 0x550 to the Ability_SupportTrait id. This replaces the by-order argument.",
  "2ae5ca1e(a, b, t) is a linear blend from a to b; 5db3c702 returns the frame time; ffe1e419(60, dt, k) turns a per-frame fraction k quoted at 60 frames per second into the fraction for this frame; the 328a61dd / 47be3d90 pair reads and writes the value kept from the previous frame.",
  "On that reading the firing multiplier is eased: each 1/60 s it moves 10% of the remaining gap toward its target (0.8 when firing, 1 otherwise). Starting or stopping fire therefore takes about 0.11 s for half the change and about 0.36 s for 90% of it."
 ],
 "unresolved": [
  "Whether ffe1e419 is exponential (1 - (1 - k)^(60 dt)) or linear (k * 60 * dt); both give k at 60 frames per second, so the timing above holds at 60 Hz and is approximate elsewhere.",
  "The native bodies of 2ae5ca1e, ffe1e419, 5db3c702, 328a61dd and 47be3d90 are not read; their meanings rest on use in the listings.",
  "Names of the CurrentSoldierWeaponType values 0 and 3 to 7."
 ],
 "siteImpact": "None now. For the L4075 movement-speed proposal: firing walk settles at x0.8 after about a third of a second, not instantly.",
